  "kind": "advisory",
  "title": "[Advisory] N-able N-central: 33 Zero-Days, Cloud Taken Offline",
  "summary": "A critical set of vulnerabilities, collectively named Able2Shell, has been disclosed in N-able\u0027s N-central remote monitoring and management platform, with public proof-of-concept exploits. Successful exploitation can expose credentials, allow rogue administrative access, and achieve root-level command execution on affected hosted and on-premises deployments. N-able has taken hosted environments offline and urged on-premises customers to shut down servers as a precaution.",
  "description": "##### SEVERITY AND IMPACT:\n- Successful exploitation could allow attackers to steal credentials, create rogue administrators, and execute commands as root on N- \u2026 (3852 characters)",
